  "description": "Kanject Core realtime abstractions — the transport-neutral contract a product pushes to connected clients on (proposal 0058): IRealtimePublisher over an audience (a user, several users, or a topic) and Core's envelope, IRealtimeAuthorizer for who may connect and subscribe, the RealtimeCapabilities each transport reports, and the connection and subscription controls of D10. Depends only on the BCL. The in-process default is Kanject.Core.Realtime; API Gateway WebSockets and AppSync Events are providers.",
